


   =====( WaitNodes V1.00 )=============================================


        Trion 'WaitNodes' Utility.

        (c) Copyright Paul Spijkerman, '94-'97. All rights reserved.

        Written for use with the Trion BBS package.


   ===================================================================


   Waitnodes is a Utility that wait until all nodes are in the
   'waiting state' and then exits.

   This is usefull if you only want to do something if all users
   are logged out.
   
   It is written for use in scripts .. you can for instance place
   it at the start of the mail script .. so the mail is only
   unpacked when no one is logged on and it won't slow down
   the system when there are users on.

   The program checks default every 60 seconds if there are
   still users but you can call it with every number of
   seconds.

   Use a -X flag at the command line for it to be quiet.


